<section class="panel"><h2 class="strip-title">Community &amp; Safety</h2><p class="compact-help">Comments and broadcasts are public plain text. Never share passwords or personal details. Use Report on a message to request moderator review. You can remove your own posts and hide comments from your profile. Reports do not automatically hide posts or award rewards.</p><p class="compact-help">Temporary rivals never post or invite players. Social posting limits are rolling 24-hour windows. This alpha has no private messaging, bank, or paid healing service; resources recover automatically.</p></section>
